#9700
`YDivergence`n~
`gThe wood diverges, the darkness split by a shining path, peace unto
turmoil conjoined by absolution.  Your feet tread, without defilement, this
silver path laid graciously before the slender trees who hold court here.  A
path of enlightenment, each step takes you further from the roads you have
mapped, into the vast unknown.  Un erringly, moved by primal curiosity, you
forget onwards, deeper and deeper, tracing your soul through the trees.`n
~
