#9701
`YPath of Enlightenment`n~
`gIronic that out here, in the middle of nowhere, amidst the hungry untamed
beasts, you feel safer than in the madness of the city.  Here in this
purity, animals abide by the laws of the jungle, logical and just.  From the
insanity of people comes the unfathomable ugliness that has corrupted known
civilization so as to have sent you searching for just this type of
vividness.`n
~
