#9702
`YA Commencement`n~
`gPushing through the closely nestled trees whose branches entertwine to
form a mural of almost impassable vegetation, you emerge into this clearing
devoid of brambles and snares.  The light shimmers down on the oddly shaped
silver pebbles surrounding this clearing, twisting and molding light in
fantastic formulations of beauty.  Your breath held, an anticipation of
something surreal gathers in your senses, forcing you pensive and
introspective.`n
~
