#9703
`W[`YAtheneum of Wondrous Knowledge`W]`n~
`gYou stand within the great library of Clan Divergent.  Massive oaken shelves
filled with varied books, scrolls, tomes and other documents of knowledge
fill this massive room.  Students can be seen studying all sorts of works
at plain but sturdy tables about the chambers.`n
~
