#9704
`YTranquility`n~
`gThe crushed marble path continues to the east and west here, a blazon
white swath of rock in the middle of an otherwise very quaint village. 
There is a feeling of easy bliss in the air here, a complete and true
harmony with everything that spins and flies and roams the world here.  At
another time, the silence and stillness of the area would be troublesome,
disconcerting.  But it just feels right somehow, as if this little village
were always meant to be permanently isolated from the world that lies
beyond.  A small cottage stands to the south here, doors open and welcome to
visitors.`d
~
3 303104 1
D2
~
~
