#9705
`YHarmony`n~
`BYou have reached an abrupt end to the marble street internally called
Harmony.  It is strange, somehow you had felt that Harmony's end would be
smoother, a more lucient transition into something else, something better
maybe.  Instead, the road looks as if it were unfinished, aspen trees that
tower up into the sky taking over where it leaves off.  In any case, a path
leads off into the forest to the east, a small dirt trail that winds its way
between tree trunks.
~
